# Virtualenvs
.venv/
.venv
venv/
venv
# NOTE: the bare forms matter. A pattern with a trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES
# only, so a `.venv` SYMLINK into a scratch worktree sailed past `.venv/` and was
# committed as a mode-120000 blob -- dangling in every other checkout, and breaking
# the README setup step because `python3 -m venv .venv` refuses an existing path.

